16484\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Greet animals and give them presents to grow your friendship. As your bond deepens they will send sweet messages or even burst into cheerful dance moves. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will have plenty of cute looks to choose from, but you will need to earn the trust of your furry little friends before new skins unlock.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Play the Demo and Wishlist</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Demo is out now 😝 Wishlist to be notified when the full game is released.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3262100/extras/0cb894cd46dc79066a2240d0364394ca.poster.avif?t=1780016484\" width=800 height=232 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3262100/extras/0cb894cd46dc79066a2240d0364394ca.webm?t=1780016484\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3262100/extras/0cb894cd46dc79066a2240d0364394ca.mp4?t=1780016484\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "short_description": "A cute action RPG with base building. Wiggle and Dash through swarms of enemies to rescue adorable animals. Build a bustling animal settlement, and let your furry friends craft powerful gear while you explore new dungeons.", "supported_languages": "English", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3262100/9008ed5cff2e857a23cd7837a7184973852fb977/header.jpg?t=1780016484", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3262100/3372bcc1a885079d2136f1bb6befc89c5e9f17a0/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1780016484", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akam